  "title": "haben va kundalik mashg'ulotlar",
  "title_de": "haben und Alltag",
  "goal": "Dars oxirida \"haben\" fe'lini barcha shaxslarda tuslaysiz, ko'p ishlatiladigan fe'llarni (machen, kochen, essen, lesen ...) hozirgi zamonda ishlatasiz va \"gern\" bilan nimani yoqtirishingizni ayta olasiz.",
  "skill_focus": [
    "grammar",
    "speaking",
    "reading"
  ],
  "explanation": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "\"haben\" (ega bo'lmoq, bor bo'lmoq) — \"sein\" dan keyingi eng muhim fe'l. O'zbekcha \"menda vaqt bor\", \"mening ishim ko'p\" gaplari nemis tilida \"haben\" bilan aytiladi: Ich habe Zeit. Ich habe viel Arbeit."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Olmosh",
        "haben",
        "essen",
        "lesen"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "ich",
